          Every paver calculator question boils down to the same math problem: area times depth divided by however much material actually fits in a single bag. The tricky part is that "how much sand do I need" has a different answer depending on whether you're filling the joints between pavers or laying the bedding layer underneath them — and most online calculators don't distinguish between the two. Ours does.
